  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beast kings ranked by group size place thousand beast king between Hundred Beast King and Myriad Beast King. The wild boar king that Sickly Snake’s group hunted was a thousand beast king ruling a thousand wild boars. Three teams must cooperate to barely kill a king of this tier; that boar king fight succeeded largely because the beast was already injured.",
      "chapters": [
        114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_beast_king",
        "sys_hundred_beast_king",
        "sys_myriad_beast_king",
        "char_gu_yue_jiao_san"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A hundred beast king stone monkey might, given years, advance to thousand beast king and completely unify its stone forest once it can control that many of its kind.",
      "chapters": [
        115
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the wolf nest, frenzy lightning wolves stand at thousand beast king level beside hundred beast king bold lightning wolves and myriad beast king thunder crown wolves.",
      "chapters": [
        130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wolf-tide-examples",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After a hundred beast king bold lightning wolf appears, reports of a thousand beast king frenzy lightning wolf follow. Meeting one with its normal wolf groups requires at least three groups cooperating, and the three clans send rank three elders to answer it.",
      "chapters": [
        131
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
